  </div>

  <p>As the following report illustrates, Career Services staff has collected data from <span data-field="total_respondents_arts_science">{{ total_respondents_arts_science }}</span> of the <span data-field="total_graduating_students_arts_science">{{ total_graduating_students_arts_science }}</span> graduating students who received a master's degree, bachelor's degree, or degree from a non-baccalaureate program within the College of Arts & Science for the specified timeframe. The average response rate was <span data-field="average_response_rate_arts_science">{{ average_response_rate_arts_science }}</span>.</p>

